	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Setup

Run `protonvpn setup` in Terminal once. It lets connecting run without your password, and signs you in to your Proton account.

## Usage

Connect to Proton VPN by country, server or mode via the `vpn` keyword.

![Connecting to a country](images/countries.png)

Type `sc`, `p2p`, `tor` or `random` before a country for that kind of server, or `fastest`, `disconnect`, `dns`, `netshield`, `kill switch` or `port forwarding` for those.
</string>
